---
import { BRAND_NAME } from '@/lib/brand';

// The pupil and the parent of docs/produit.md, "Pour qui", told by the evening rather than by the child's faults; that
// organisation can be learned, docs/methode.md, "À retenir".
---

{/* The sections alternate two planes, the background and the secondary surface, rather than lines between them. */}
<section class="bg-secondary py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-32">
  <div class="container grid max-w-6xl gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
    {/* On a phone, the long sentence reads as a text, not as a poster. */}
    <h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug text-pretty text-foreground sm:text-3xl sm:leading-snug lg:col-span-10 lg:text-4xl lg:leading-snug">
      Le soir, savoir par où commencer n&apos;est pas simple. Un contrôle s&apos;oublie, un devoir reste à moitié fait, et la soirée tourne à la
      dispute. <span class="text-muted-foreground">Ou personne n&apos;est là pour aider ce soir-là.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="max-w-md text-lg text-muted-foreground lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-6 lg:text-xl">
      Parfois, c&apos;est l&apos;organisation qui bloque, plus que les leçons. Nous construisons {BRAND_NAME} pour ces soirs-là.{' '}
      <strong class="font-bold text-foreground">Et l&apos;organisation, ça s&apos;apprend.</strong>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
